{
  "description": "The strict money parser (parseMoney): a typed or shown dollar string to integer cents, with integer math only. allowNegative defaults to false. A result is {ok: true, cents} or {ok: false, reason}; reason is EMPTY, INVALID, TOO_MANY_DECIMALS, NEGATIVE_NOT_ALLOWED or TOO_LARGE.",
